Related to {{cog|uk|поки}}, {{cog|be|пакуль}}, {{cog|pl|póki}}, from {{m|ru|по}} + {{m|orv|кꙑи}}, in Russian with analogous formation after
{{m|ru|дока}}, {{m|ru|пота}} (Vasmer 1958).

{{s|Interjection}} Short form of {{m|ru|[[прощай]] [[пока]]||farewell for now}} or {{m|ru|[[пока]] [[до свидания]]}}. Used since the early 20th century first as colloquial, thereafter as familiar. May be a calque from some other language, compare {{cog|en|so long}} (used since 19th century) and {{cog|sv|hej så länge}}.

